#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a project"
msgstr "Crear un proyecto"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "In this guide we'll provide commands for both [Docker](https://docs.docker.com/get-started/get-docker/) and the built-in dev server with everything installed locally."
msgstr "En esta guía daremos los comandos tanto para [Docker](https://docs.docker.com/get-started/get-docker/) como para el servidor de desarrollo integrado, con todo instalado en local."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> If you want to use another web server,\n"
"> see [\"Configuring web servers\"](../../cookbook/configuring-webservers/general.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> Si quieres usar otro servidor web,\n"
"> consulta [\"Configurar servidores web\"](../../cookbook/configuring-webservers/general.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "We recommend starting with a project template that's a minimal working Yii project implementing some basic features.  It can serve as a good starting point for your projects."
msgstr "Te recomendamos empezar con una plantilla de proyecto, que es un proyecto Yii mínimo y funcional que implementa algunas funcionalidades básicas. Puede ser un buen punto de partida para tus proyectos."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "You can create a new project from a template using the [Composer](https://getcomposer.org) package manager:"
msgstr "Puedes crear un proyecto nuevo a partir de una plantilla con el gestor de paquetes [Composer](https://getcomposer.org):"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer create-project yiisoft/app your_project\n"
msgstr "composer create-project yiisoft/app your_project\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "Docker users can run the following commands:"
msgstr "Si usas Docker, puedes ejecutar los siguientes comandos:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"docker run --rm -it -v \"$(pwd):/app\" --user $(id -u):$(id -g) composer/composer create-project yiisoft/app your_project\n"
"sudo chown -R $(id -u):$(id -g) your_project\n"
"cd your_project\n"
"make composer update\n"
msgstr ""
"docker run --rm -it -v \"$(pwd):/app\" --user $(id -u):$(id -g) composer/composer create-project yiisoft/app your_project\n"
"sudo chown -R $(id -u):$(id -g) your_project\n"
"cd your_project\n"
"make composer update\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "If you want development version instead of release one:"
msgstr "Si quieres la versión de desarrollo en lugar de una versión publicada:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/yiisoft/app.git --depth 1 your_project && \\\n"
"cd your_project && \\\n"
"rm -rf .git && \\\n"
"make composer update\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/yiisoft/app.git --depth 1 your_project && \\\n"
"cd your_project && \\\n"
"rm -rf .git && \\\n"
"make composer update\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "This installs the latest stable version of the Yii project template in a directory named `your_project`.  You can choose a different directory name if you want."
msgstr "Esto instala la última versión estable de la plantilla de proyecto de Yii en un directorio llamado `your_project`. Si quieres, puedes elegir otro nombre de directorio."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!TIP]\n"
"> If you want to install the latest development version of Yii, you may add `--stability=dev` to the command.\n"
"> Don't use the development version of Yii for production because it may break your running code.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!TIP]\n"
"> Si quieres instalar la última versión de desarrollo de Yii, puedes añadir `--stability=dev` al comando.\n"
"> No uses la versión de desarrollo de Yii en producción, porque podría romper tu código en ejecución.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "Go into the newly created directory, copy `.env.example` to `.env`, and run:"
msgstr "Entra en el directorio recién creado, copia `.env.example` a `.env` y ejecuta:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "./yii serve --port=80\n"
msgstr "./yii serve --port=80\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "For Docker users, run:"
msgstr "Si usas Docker, ejecuta:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "make up\n"
msgstr "make up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "Open your browser to the URL `http://localhost/`."
msgstr "Abre en tu navegador la URL `http://localhost/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> To change the port for the built-in server, pass `--port` to `./yii serve`. For Docker, set `DEV_PORT`\n"
"> in `docker/.env`.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> Para cambiar el puerto del servidor integrado, pasa `--port` a `./yii serve`. En Docker, establece `DEV_PORT`\n"
"> en `docker/.env`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/creating-project.md
msgid "![Successful Installation of Yii](/images/guide/start/app-installed.png)"
msgstr "![Instalación correcta de Yii](/images/guide/start/app-installed.png)"
